ques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"r6_wKaVLLnYT31oGnxFuHA","review_id":"BHj_wTsK0C5EQxFNXsHFGA","date":"2015-01-07T18:25:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9425709247589111,"text_excerpt":"A very nice place to stay and visit New Orleans. You are in walking distance to the French Quarter. It seems to be a safe walk, you go right by the Police station on the way. We walked to the Quarter and back every day with no issues. The park is well set up and the sites are level, and paved. The facilities are nice here. They even have very good free coffee in the office, a big plus."},{"business_id":"r6_wKaVLLnYT31oGnxFuHA","review_id":"rvAsiFo_b8KtbMHwCHIPhw","date":"2021-03-11T14:34:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9234111309051514,"text_excerpt":"I booked this spot based on location alone without reading reviews. As I got closer, I started reading and was a little worried with some of the bad reviews. Then turning two streets before there is a a sign for it thats tagged up and I was still worried about what I had booked. However upon arrival at the front gate it was nice and secured. The girl who helped us check in was nice and we ended up paying a little more for a better spot by the office to be closer to the bathrooms. The spot also came with a private gazebo and full bar with bbqs. The photo of the gazebo really doesn't do justice but they're super cute and netted. This is a PERFECT location to walk to the French quarters. The..."},{"business_id":"r6_wKaVLLnYT31oGnxFuHA","review_id":"r3_kdbHwEt4CJvS36ckf6g","date":"2018-05-20T18:17:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8954697847366333,"text_excerpt":"Great location close to Bourbon street, 5-10 minute walk. Very clean resort, friendly service. We're in a Prevo's bus A little tight coming off I 10 into the resort but awesome area for your stay. We will return."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
